A pipeline configuration is an ordinary ``dict`` with this shape::

    {
        "name": "etl",
        "defaults": {
            "priority": 0,
            "timeout": 30,
            "retry": {"max_attempts": 1, "backoff": "constant", "base": 0},
            "resources": {},
        },
        "tasks": [
            {"id": "extract", "action": extract_fn},
            {
                "id": "transform",
                "action": transform_fn,
                "deps": ["extract"],
                "priority": 5,
                "retry": {"max_attempts": 3},
            },
            ...
        ],
    }

